# Anchor-proof verifier environment — template.
# Live file: /etc/desk-anchor-proofs/anchor.env (root:root 0600, never committed).
#
# Names only. Do not commit values. Do not write VAR= with an empty right-hand
# side: systemd would set the variable to empty, and verify-anchor-proofs.sh
# would keep that empty value instead of its default.
#
# Omit a line to keep the script default:
#   GREPTIME_HTTP_URL    http://127.0.0.1:4000
#   SOLANA_DEVNET_RPC    https://api.devnet.solana.com
#   DRY_RUN              false   (leave unset on the hourly timer)
#
# REPORT_OUTPUT_DIR is set by verify-anchor-proofs.service to
# /var/lib/desk-anchor-proofs (StateDirectory=desk-anchor-proofs). Override it
# only to another path the unit can write. ProtectSystem=strict blocks writes
# outside that state directory unless the unit is changed.
#
# GREPTIME_HTTP_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4000
# SOLANA_DEVNET_RPC=https://api.devnet.solana.com
# DRY_RUN=false
# REPORT_OUTPUT_DIR=/var/lib/desk-anchor-proofs
